          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\overline{\\overline{I}} = \\left[\\begin{matrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1.45 \\cdot 10^{-46} & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 1.45 \\cdot 10^{-46}\\end{matrix}\\right]$"
        }
